-- Provenance: (~220-246 Hz) while the sample's own root is ~C4 — so those chords played the
-- Provenance: string machine at 0.6-0.7x, and its tape/chorus wobble stretched into a slow
-- Provenance: unstable low triad. Third time this trap has bitten (marimba dragging at gs3,
-- Provenance: the +12 squeak, now this): a sampled voice must stay near its natural register.
-- Provenance: To bring a pad back: keep every root at fs4 or above, or pick a sample with a
-- Provenance: lower root, or use a synth voice instead of a sample.
